WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:08.600
You need two matching containers, bagged topsoil, grass for one container, either

2
00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:12.980
sod or seed sown two to three weeks ahead, and two clear plastic cups.

3
00:00:13.850 --> 00:00:17.550
Fill both containers with the same soil, about five centimeters deep.

4
00:00:18.030 --> 00:00:20.350
One gets grass, from seed or sod.

5
00:00:20.950 --> 00:00:22.990
You cut a small notch at the low end of each.

6
00:00:23.390 --> 00:00:24.810
Raise the other ends on books.

7
00:00:25.683 --> 00:00:28.223
Pour two cups of water slowly over each tray.

8
00:00:28.663 --> 00:00:31.283
The cup from the bare tray is usually brown and cloudy.

9
00:00:31.783 --> 00:00:34.323
The cup from the grass tray is usually much clearer.

10
00:00:35.217 --> 00:00:36.837
Stay with your child the whole time.

11
00:00:37.217 --> 00:00:40.517
You do all the cutting, and you lift the wet trays, because they are heavy.
